classDiagram
  class User {
    +Long id
    +String account
    +String password
    +String nickname
    +Integer role
    +Integer status
  }
  class Item {
    +Long id
    +String type
    +String title
    +String category
    +String location
    +String status
    +Integer auditStatus
    +Long userId
  }
  class ItemImage {
    +Long id
    +Long itemId
    +String imgUrl
    +Long phash
  }
  class ClaimRecord {
    +Long id
    +Long itemId
    +Long claimantId
    +String proof
    +String contact
    +String status
    +String reply
  }
  class Message {
    +Long id
    +Long userId
    +String type
    +String title
    +Integer isRead
  }
  class AdminLog {
    +Long id
    +Long adminId
    +String action
    +Long targetId
  }
  class Favorite {
    +Long id
    +Long userId
    +Long itemId
  }
  class Delivery {
    +Long id
    +Long userId
    +String bizType
    +Long bizId
    +String filePath
    +String mimeType
    +Integer status
  }
  class WatchSubscription {
    +Long id
    +Long userId
    +String planCode
    +String cycle
    +Integer status
    +LocalDateTime expireTime
  }
  class WatchTarget {
    +Long id
    +Long userId
    +Long phash
    +String label
    +String imgUrl
    +Integer status
    +Integer hitCount
    +Long lastHitItemId
  }
  User "1" --> "*" Item : 发布
  Item "1" --> "*" ItemImage : 含图(带pHash)
  Item "1" --> "*" ClaimRecord : 被申请
  User "1" --> "*" ClaimRecord : 发起
  User "1" --> "*" Message : 接收
  User "1" --> "*" AdminLog : 留痕
  User "1" --> "*" Favorite : 收藏
  Item "1" --> "*" Favorite : 被收藏
  User "1" --> "*" Delivery : 接收交付
  Item "1" --> "*" Delivery : 产出交付
  User "1" --> "1" WatchSubscription : 订阅(一人一条)
  User "1" --> "*" WatchTarget : 守望
  note for ItemImage "phash: BIGINT 存 64位指纹\n检索: BIT_COUNT(phash^q)"
  note for Delivery "业务只声明→落 delivery 表→UI 读表\n文件走受控下载/桌面 IPC 原生打开"
  note for WatchTarget "phash 与 item_image 同口径\n招领审核通过时反查命中(v2.20)"
